os/scene-clips/7461.mp4","videoBytes":125533,"duration":4.041667},"5560f7effd31":{"text":"Do people really watch soap operas?","id":"5560f7effd31","source":"BTS 23 · #83","image":"/img/scene-clips/7471.webp","imageBytes":16488,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7471.mp4","videoBytes":104530,"duration":4.041667},"67ac9642b401":{"text":"It is when advertisements are shown.","id":"67ac9642b401","source":"BTS 23 · #40","image":"/img/scene-clips/7487.webp","imageBytes":16770,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7487.mp4","videoBytes":114424,"duration":4.041667},"3d6d6a04acba":{"text":"Have you watched a live event on TV?","id":"3d6d6a04acba","source":"BTS 23 · #63","image":"/img/scene-clips/7498.webp","imageBytes":27834,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7498.mp4","videoBytes":211118,"duration":4.041667},"6d488699247a":{"text":"It is a show with multiple episodes.","id":"6d488699247a","source":"BTS 23 · #66","image":"/img/scene-clips/7499.webp","imageBytes":15250,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7499.mp4","videoBytes":123288,"duration":4.041667}},"examples":["Have you watched a live event on TV?","What's on TV tonight?","There is a documentary about animals.","I like watching cartoons.","Yes, I use a DVR to record my favorite shows.","It is a show with multiple episodes.","My favorite show is on at eight o'clock.","I watch soccer matches and tennis tournaments.","The news reporter said it will rain tomorrow.","Did you watch the news today?","Yes, I saw an interesting report about technology.","Some are interesting, but many are fake.","What kind of TV shows do you like?","I like comedy shows. They make me laugh.","How many hours of TV do you watch a day?","I watch about one hour of TV a day.","Do you skip commercials?","Commercials try to make you buy things.","Do you believe everything you see on TV?","No, you should think carefully about what you see.","Have you ever been on TV?","No, but I would like to be on a game show.","What makes a good advertisement?","Too much TV is not good for your eyes.","Reading a book is better than watching TV.","What did you learn from the news today?","I learned about a new discovery in science.","I really enjoy watching crime dramas.","Do you have a television in your bedroom?","Yes, but I don't watch it very often.","How do you choose what to watch?","I check the TV guide or watch recommendations.","What time do you usually watch TV?","I watch in the evening after dinner.","Do you watch TV with your family?","Yes, we watch together on weekends.","It is a program about real events or people.","Do people really watch soap operas?","Do you like nature documentaries?","Yes, they are very educational.","What about sports on TV?","What is a commercial break?","It is when advertisements are shown.","How long is each episode?","How long are commercial breaks?","Usually about two to three minutes.","Yes, I fast forward when I can.","It should be memorable and creative.","Do ads influence your purchases?","Sometimes, but I try to be careful.","What is a news broadcast?","It is a program about current events.","Yes, I like to stay informed.","What kinds of news stories interest you?","What is a weather report?","It tells you what the weather will be.","Is the weather forecast always accurate?","No, sometimes it changes.","It is a program shown as it happens.","Yes, I watched the Olympics live.","It is a long-running dramatic TV series.","Do you watch series online?","Yes, many services offer streaming.","What is a reality TV show?","It shows real people in various situations.","What is a talk show?","The host interviews guests and talks about topics.","I like hosts who are funny and engaging.","What is a sitcom?","It is a short comedy series.","Usually about thirty minutes.","What is a soap opera?","Yes, they have dedicated fans.","Contestants play games and win prizes.","Have you ever wanted to be on a game show?","Yes, I would like to win money.","What is a talent show?","People showcase their special talents.","I would sing or dance.","Can you stream TV shows?","What are popular streaming services?","Netflix, Amazon Prime, and Disney Plus.","Is cable TV still popular?","What is on-demand television?","You can watch shows whenever you want."]}
